1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:02,239
Watch the dots ride the curves.

2
00:00:02,239 --> 00:00:05,625
At the mean position, everything is kinetic.

3
00:00:05,625 --> 00:00:08,971
At the extremes, everything is potential.

4
00:00:08,971 --> 00:00:14,062
In between, the two always add up to the same total, the dashed line.

